      "source_url": "https://thaqalayn.net/hadith/28/1/9/2",
      "text": [
        ": حدثنا محمد بن الحسن الصفار، عن محمد بن الحسين بن أبي الخطاب، عن علي بن أسباط، عن سليم مولى طربال، عن هشام الجواليقي، قال: سألت أبا عبد الله عليه السلام عن قول الله عز وجل \" سبحان الله \" ما يعني به؟ قال: تنزيه."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.basel-kadem": [
          "2.\tWe were told by Muhammed bin Hasan bin Ahmad bin Waleed, may Allah be pleased with him, that he said: We were told by Muhammed bin Hasan al-Saffar, from Muhammed bin Hussain bin Abi Talib, from Ali bin Asbat, from Sulaym, the servant of Tarbal, from Hisham al-Jawaleeqi, that he said: I asked Abu Abdillah, peace be upon him, of the saying of Allah, Exalted and Glorious is He: «Glorified be Allah» <a href=\"/books/quran:23#h91\">[23:91]</a> What does He mean with it? He said: Extolment."
        ]
      }
